          "name": "fill",
          "returns": "ke_result",
          "tags": [],
          "doc": "Fills a config struct: writes each field\u0027s default, then the value the store holds for the field\u0027s key in section. A key holding a type the field cannot take is logged and leaves the default; an integer is accepted by a float or double field. A string field points at the store\u0027s copy, valid as get_string\u0027s result is.",
          "return_doc": "KE_OK, or KE_RESULT_INVALID_ARGUMENT for a null argument or a field whose size does not fit its type; fields before it are already written.",
